        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One arena. Endless undead. Smash or be eaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The virus spread fast. Society fell faster. Now you’re stuck in tight, makeshift combat zones overrun with the infected. With only your reflexes, a handful of power-ups, and pure grit, you’ll fight wave after wave of zombies in a fast-paced survival arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Smash delivers retro-style top-down gameplay with a modern twist: tight arenas, constant pressure, and satisfying zombie destruction. All backed by bold visuals and a high-energy soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧟 Survive the Horde</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead don’t stop coming. Clear waves with precision and speed or get overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Power-Up Mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow time, trigger chain lightning, unleash nukes, and more. The right power-up can turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧨 Arena-Based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small handcrafted maps create fast, focused battles. Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 Retro Action Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom music keeps the adrenaline pumping as the chaos ramps up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕹️ Pure Arcade Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No online required. No accounts. No microtransactions. Just gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💻 Built for Windows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs natively on Windows 10 and above (64-bit).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for smooth and responsive arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 How It Works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Drop into a closed zombie-infested arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Move fast, shoot faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Grab power-ups. Avoid swarms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Last as long as you can. Then go again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a shot at glory. And a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready. Aim. Smash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead are waiting.</p>",
