ass=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 How It Works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Drop into a closed zombie-infested arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Move fast, shoot faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Grab power-ups. Avoid swarms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Last as long as you can. Then go again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a shot at glory. And a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⸻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready. Aim. Smash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead are waiting.</p>",
        "short_description": "Zombie Smash is a thrilling 2D top-down arcade-style game where players face endless waves of zombies. Packed with adrenaline-fueled action, power-ups, and fast-paced gameplay, this game challenges your reflexes as you survive and smash your way through hordes of the undead.",
